     A*----------------------------------------------------------------
     A* CUSMAS - CUSTOMER MASTER PHYSICAL FILE
     A* KEY: CUSID CHAR(9)  FORMAT AAA999999
     A*----------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R CUSREC
     A            CUSID          9A         TEXT('CUSTOMER KEY')
     A            CUSNAM        20A         TEXT('CUSTOMER NAME')
     A            CUSREG         3A         TEXT('REGION CODE')
     A            CUSCRD         8S 2       TEXT('CREDIT LIMIT')
     A          K CUSID
